	<section_number>3.2-5117</section_number>
	<catch_line>Penalty for violation; misdemeanor</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any person violating any of the provisions of §§ 3.2-5106 through 3.2-5116 is guilty of a Class 3 misdemeanor.
	</text>
